===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|grafa||to dig}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*grabaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{m|ine-pro|*gʰrābʰ-||to dig, scratch, scrape}}.

